cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you reference Gridea Pro, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "Gridea Pro"
abstract: "Gridea Pro is a free, open-source, cross-platform desktop client for writing and publishing static blogs on macOS, Windows and Linux. It is created and maintained by Eliauk (GitHub: @Tespera), with contributions from the community. Built from scratch with Go, Wails and Vue 3, Gridea Pro is a rewrite of Gridea, the open-source blog client by EryouHao that has been unmaintained since 2022. It is compatible with existing Gridea sites and themes, and is licensed under GPL-3.0."
authors:
  - alias: "Eliauk"
    name: "Eliauk"
    website: "https://are.ink/"
  - name: "Gridea Pro contributors"
repository-code: "https://github.com/Gridea-Pro/gridea-pro"
url: "https://gridea.pro/"
license: GPL-3.0-only
date-released: "2026-03-15"
keywords:
  - static blog
  - static site generator
  - blog client
  - markdown editor
  - desktop app
  - Gridea
  - Gridea Pro
  - Wails
  - MCP
